{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Star Adventure</strong> is the 1-bit RPG that with active combat using direction inputs and timing to dodge each attack!<br><br> The ship Explorer-01 hits a meteor field above <strong>Astralis</strong>, a planet full of weird tech, weird places, and even weirder creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: Find your lost crew. Simple, but everything on Astralis is either broken, cursed, alive, or some combo of the three. You'll explore the planet, barter with shady shops, and maybe punch a <strong>Shardkin</strong> or two.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat\u2019s tactical but snappy. Dialogue\u2019s weird. The whole thing plays like a forgotten Game Boy cart someone modded to have feelings.<br>It\u2019s lonely out there, but not quiet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Active Turn-Based Combat</strong> - Engaging fights where timing is important!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Damage Types</strong> - Balance <strong>Physical</strong>, <strong>Energy</strong>, and <strong>Mind</strong> attacks with their own stats to upgrade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration-Focused Gameplay</strong> - Search open zones, solve light puzzles, and find your crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dialogue-Rich Story</strong> - Strange characters, cryptic lore, and a choice that shape how you\u2019re remembered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original 1-bit Visual Style</strong> - Crisp pixel art in stark contrast with strange alien designs :)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555860?t=1767711984","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555860/d72160ed0c4674fb692e309afb8ac74c5ae4f92d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767711984","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s