ual Style</strong> - Crisp pixel art in stark contrast with strange alien designs :)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Peter Stubbs"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555860/ac4fbe7fffaa7513fb6bf47b63698cc8028b00b0/header.jpg?t=1767711984","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3555860/828362771/2ebcd0e9f90d3e7393f851c87da8a67eb6b7284a/1763998280/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766539574","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3555860/828362771/2ebcd0e9f90d3e7393f851c87da8a67eb6b7284a/1763998280/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766539574","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3555860/828362771/2ebcd0e9f90d3e7393f851c87da8a67eb6b7284a/1763998280/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766539574","id":257237064,"name":"Super Star X Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257237064/3e3aedffafbcb4ec3e51028c15aeb78d61500316/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766539574"}],"name":"Super Star Adventure","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Super Star Adventure - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$9.99</span> $1.99 USD","packageid":1254772,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-80% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":199}],"title":"Buy Super Star Adventure"}]